sequenceDiagram
  actor PCU as PCU agent
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as api
  participant PRI as priority
  participant REB as rebooking (CP-SAT)
  participant CARE as care + rewards
  participant EXP as explain
  PCU->>UI: flight cancelled
  UI->>API: POST /scenarios (flight, CANCEL)
  API->>PRI: affected passengers + attributes
  PRI-->>API: tier + score + points per attribute
  API->>REB: alternatives: same O&D, sold SHJ connections, seats, priority
  REB-->>API: assignment, groups kept together, unprotected → next day
  API->>CARE: meals, hotel, transport, refund option
  API->>EXP: reasons + message drafts
  API-->>UI: priority list, rebooking plan, care, aircraft out of position
  PCU->>UI: change weights → re-run (what-if)
  PCU->>UI: set goodwill budget → reward plan
  PCU->>UI: approve plan / messages (audited)
